<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1cbee73815d4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1796] Huang was killed when his vehicle veered into a concrete divider along U.S. 101 at the state Route 85 left-hand carpool lane off-ramp." ;
