    airo:evidenceText "[1562] Documents filed in San Jose federal court by widow Tomomi Umeda and daughter Miyu Umeda claimed Yoshihiro Umeda, 44, was the victim of a 'patent defect' in Tesla's technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1562" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2febe3354a4b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1796] Data shows that at the time, Tesla's Autopilot feature was enabled." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1796" .

